# NOTE: `prisma/migrations/*/migration.sql` was ignored here.
#
# Migrations are SOURCE, not build output. Ignoring them meant only
# `migration_lock.toml` was ever committed, so the schema history did not travel
# with the repo: a clone had a `schema.prisma` and a Prisma client expecting
# columns no migration could create, and `prisma migrate deploy` on a fresh
# environment had nothing to apply. Do not add it back.
